+"""Recurring scientific TASK insert; numerical sheet stays outside the prompt."""
+
+PRODUCT_PARTITION_TASK = """Examine which products or substrate forms were identified in the selected preparation and what their reported fractions actually measure. Keep assayed molecule, organism, construct, preparation, each compound, endpoint, measurement basis, denominator, endpoint stage and time linked to exact source passages. Determine whether the selected fractions describe the same mixture at the same endpoint and share the same denominator; retain unknown or conflicting relationships without discarding each reported quantity. Distinguish amount composition, instrument-signal partition and an unresolved basis. Equilibrium composition is not a molecular formation rate, substrate specificity or enzyme-specific attribution. Product coexistence does not imply molecular replacement.
+
+Examine contaminating contributors, matched controls and preparation changes separately: changed purification, tags, temperatures or times may alter comparability while a contaminant separately limits effect isolation. Retain the paper's uncertainty and repetition meaning; scans, repeated representations and complementary identity measurements are not independent preparations. A sum of selected fractions equal to one is numerical closure of that selected report, not an independent mass balance or proof that side products are absent.
+
+Use available source reading or permitted narrower investigations to resolve these questions; choose supported number/unit spans and constrained experimental meanings for the deterministic reader. A reported point does not mean exact physical measurement. Select a species-specific measurement identity rather than labeling both different species with one scalar identity. Preserve lower/upper limits and approximation. Requesting a derived component does not request its native operands; select concise scientific-meaning witnesses so an unrequested numerical operand need not be disclosed. Return only the parent's requested components and their needed scientific meanings. Missing measurements remain unknown. Unimplemented numerical uncertainty propagation is an implementation limit, not proof that the source omitted uncertainty. Keep reference evidence separate from target correspondence and annotation credit."""
+
+__all__ = ["PRODUCT_PARTITION_TASK"]
